  "description_short": "Relaxed pub and grill in Herolds Bay serving hearty meals and cold drinks near the beach.",
  "description_long": "Oasis Pub & Grill sits in the coastal village of Herolds Bay, just outside Mossel Bay, offering a laid-back spot for a meal after a day at the beach. The atmosphere is casual and unpretentious, with a menu that covers pub classics—think burgers, steaks, and grills done simply and well. It's the kind of place where locals gather for a beer and visitors stop in for a bite without fuss.\n\nThe location puts you close to Herolds Bay's sandy stretch and the dramatic coastline that defines this part of the Garden Route. Whether you're after a filling lunch or a relaxed dinner with friends, Oasis delivers straightforward pub fare in a friendly setting. It's a no-frills option that does what it does honestly.",
